    text: "Affected southbound trips:\r\n4:11 am from Englewood Station\r\n5:15 am from 18th & Stout Station\r\n7:15 am from 18th & Stout Station\r\n9:15 am from 18th & Stout Station\r\n11:00 am from 18th & Stout Station\r\n\nAffected northbound trips:\r\n4:37 am from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n6:37 am from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n8:37 am from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n10:22 am from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n12:07 pm from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station"
